{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_singularity_descartes","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_singularity_descartes","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.IntervalCases","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum.DivMod","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Divisibility.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.descartes_kummer_root_levels","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.descartes_kummer_root_levels","kind":"theorem","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_singularity_descartes.lean#L29-L42","doc":"**Kummer root levels of the Descartes universe.** For `n ≥ 1`, `n` divides\n`χ = -6` exactly when `n ∈ {1, 2, 3, 6}`. This is the arithmetic content of\nitem 2 of `thm:ns-singularity-descartes`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:thm:ns-singularity-descartes","label":"thm:ns-singularity-descartes","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/ns-singularity-descartes.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}